        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Swarm 2</strong> is the sequel to my Abyssal Boss Rush!<br>Faster, more dynamic, more exhilarating!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a deep-sea creature commanding a swarm of <strong>hornets</strong>, and annihilate your enemies using a wide range of powers and mutations at your disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvements and Additions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digestion system</strong> for hornet generation. The stats and effects of your hornets vary depending on what you consume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutation system</strong> that you can equip to enhance your abilities and overall power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge system</strong> to unlock even more unique mutations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental damage system</strong> (electricity, necrosis, frost, poison, bleeding).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved performance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even more epic music!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss will make you explore a new way to play and force you to adapt your combat approach!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Swarm 2</strong> is the sequel to my Abyssal Boss Rush!<br>Faster, more dynamic, more exhilarating!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a deep-sea creature commanding a swarm of <strong>hornets</strong>, and annihilate your enemies using a wide range of powers and mutations at your disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvements and Additions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digestion system</strong> for hornet generation. The stats and effects of your hornets vary depending on what you consume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutation system</strong> that you can equip to enhance your abilities and overall power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge system</strong> to unlock even more unique mutations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental damage system</strong> (electricity, necrosis, frost, poison, bleeding).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved performance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even more epic music!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss will make you explore a new way to play and force you to adapt your combat approach!</p>",
        "short_description": "Destroy bosses one after another in this fast-paced and dynamic abyssal bullet hell!",
